---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for marcobacis.dev.">
	<article class="privacy-page prose">
		<h1>Privacy</h1>
		<p>This site is a personal portfolio and blog. It does not require an account and does not intentionally collect contact details, passwords, or other sensitive information.</p>
		<h2>Analytics</h2>
		<p>The site uses Umami Analytics to understand aggregate traffic and improve the experience. Analytics requests are sent to <code>analytics.marcobacis.dev</code>. No advertising profile is created.</p>
		<h2>External services</h2>
		<p>Links to GitHub, LinkedIn, Goodreads, and other external sites are opened on those services’ own terms and privacy policies. The site does not control their data practices.</p>
		<h2>Questions</h2>
		<p>If you have a privacy question, <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.</p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
